  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Juridisk reform BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal reform in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to gradually establish an appropriate legal environment for BiH&apos;s development towards a freemarket economy, the project aims at reforming the country&apos;s economic legislation and its economically relevant juridical organisations and structures. Reforming both, economic legislation as such as well as the structures and organisations will prepare BiH for a more close relatio with the EU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttning &#xE4;r att reformera BiHs ekonomiska lagstiftning, juridiska institutioner och strukturer. Det f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade resultatet &#xE4;r att projektet preparerar grunden f&#xF6;r ett juridisk ramverk som st&#xF6;der BiHs utveckling mot en marknadsekonomi och landets fortsatta dialog med EU och andra internationella akt&#xF6;rer.</narrative>
  </description>
